  "description": "Proposed Works (Prior Approval – Larger Home Extension): Construction of a single‑storey rear extension projecting 8m from the rear wall of the original dwellinghouse. The extension will have a maximum overall height of 4m, with any portion within 2.01m of a boundary restricted to a maximum height of 3m. \nThe proposal is intended to comply with Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A (Larger Home Extension / neighbour consultation), including the requirements that the 8m depth applies to a detached house, with the site not being on Article 2(3) land and not an SSSI. The external materials will be of similar appearance, and that the development will not result in more than half the curtilage of the original house being covered by buildings. ",
